  "title": "Frequency Tagging of Syntactic Structure or Lexical Properties",
  "description": "A magnetoencephalography (MEG) dataset from a frequency-tagging study of syntactic structure and lexical properties in language processing. The recordings are organized in BIDS format and are intended for investigating neural tracking of linguistic structure.",
